# data — IGNORE THE WHOLE DIRECTORY, not a list of extensions.
#
# 2026-09-24: this used to be `data/*.sqlite` plus a couple of friends, which
# left data/_ae.tgz, data/_backend_now.tgz, data/_w.tgz and data/vault/ (signed
# trade records) committable. Every one of those is this desk's own history.
# An allow-list of what may be committed is the only safe shape here, because
# the next thing written into data/ will not be on any deny-list.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.txt
logs/
# os
.DS_Store
